{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ee7c8-b56c-7b91-9f27-c365c936f9c6", "item_id": "item-112", "rollout_ordinal": 675, "created_at_ms": 1782005521715, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 675, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-112", "text": "Listo. Creé las tres figuras en formato **editable draw.io**, **SVG para Word** y **PNG de previsualización**.\n\n**Figura 1.1**\n\n![Figura 1.1](C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\figuras\\figura_1_1_herramientas_apoyo_vocal.png)\n\n[Editar en draw.io](C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\figuras\\figura_1_1_herramientas_apoyo_vocal.drawio) · [Insertar SVG](C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\figuras\\figura_1_1_herramientas_apoyo_vocal.svg)\n\n**Figura 1.2**\n\n![Figura 1.2](C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\figuras\\figura_1_2_brecha_interpretacion.png)\n\n[Editar en draw.io](C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\figuras\\figura_1_2_brecha_interpretacion.drawio) · [Insertar SVG](C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\figuras\\figura_1_2_brecha_interpretacion.svg)\n\n**Figura 1.3**\n\n![Figura 1.3](C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\figuras\\figura_1_3_flujo_solucion.png)\n\n[Editar en draw.io](C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\figuras\\figura_1_3_flujo_solucion.drawio) · [Insertar SVG](C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\figuras\\figura_1_3_flujo_solucion.svg)\n\nVerifiqué visualmente las tres figuras y validé la estructura XML de los archivos editables. Para la memoria conviene insertar las versiones SVG.", "phase": "final_answer", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ee7cf-d1d7-7193-b3a4-c35aad87941a", "item_id": "item-113", "rollout_ordinal": 682, "created_at_ms": 1782005617231, "item_type": "userMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 682, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "userMessage", "id": "item-113", "clientId": "5477e473-af42-4e86-b6a6-92ee1c5cdb88", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "puedes hacerlo con iconos?\n", "text_elements": []}]}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ee7cf-d1d7-7193-b3a4-c35aad87941a", "item_id": "item-114", "rollout_ordinal": 684, "created_at_ms": 1782005652647, "item_type": "agentMessage", "updated_at_ordinal": 684, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "agentMessage", "id": "item-114", "text": "Sí. Los añadiré como iconos lineales discretos, no como ilustraciones decorativas: micrófono, nota musical, onda, gráfico, grabación, alineación y comentario. Los colocaré dentro de cada bloque sin reducir la legibilidad ni romper el estilo académico, y conservaré los archivos editables de draw.io.", "phase": "commentary", "memoryCitation": null, "delivery": null, "questions": null}}
{"record_type": "item", "metadata": {"thread_id": "019eb3a5-07e3-7163-a098-145f9d55e5f3", "turn_id": "019ee7cf-d1d7-7193-b3a4-c35aad87941a", "item_id": "exec-27a6823d-f6d2-4f15-a3ff-e396ff02ee5b", "rollout_ordinal": 687, "created_at_ms": 1782005692654, "item_type": "fileChange", "updated_at_ordinal": 687, "started_at_ms": null, "completed_at_ms": null}, "item": {"type": "fileChange", "id": "exec-27a6823d-f6d2-4f15-a3ff-e396ff02ee5b", "changes": [{"path": "C:\\Users\\Diego Tapia\\Desktop\\Pene\\U\\Tesis\\tesis_karaoke\\docs\\figuras\\generar_figuras_capitulo1.py", "kind": {"type": "update", "move_path": null}, "diff": "@@ -1,2 +1,3 @@\n from pathlib import Path\n+from urllib.parse import quote\n from xml.sax.saxutils import escape\n@@ -23,2 +24,47 @@\n \n+ICONS = {\n+    \"voice\": '<path d=\"M4 12h3l2-5 4 10 2-5h5\"/>',\n+    \"process\": '<rect x=\"3\" y=\"5\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"15\" y=\"5\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"9\" y=\"15\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\"/><path d=\"M9 8h6M18 11v2l-6 2M6 11v2l6 2\"/>',\n+    \"features\": '<path d=\"M4 16l4-5 4 3 5-7 3 3\"/><path d=\"M4 20h16\"/>',\n+    \"score\": '<path d=\"M5 19V9M12 19V5M19 19v-7\"/><path d=\"M3 19h18\"/>',\n+    \"user\": '<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"4\"/><path d=\"M4 21c1-5 15-5 16 0\"/>',\n+    \"audio\": '<path d=\"M4 12h3l2-4 3 8 3-8 2 4h3\"/>',\n+    \"numbers\": '<path d=\"M5 19V9M12 19V5M19 19v-7\"/><path d=\"M3 19h18\"/>',\n+    \"warning\": '<path d=\"M12 3L2.5 20h19L12 3z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v5M12 17h.01\"/>',\n+    \"info\": '<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 11v6M12 7h.01\"/>',\n+    \"music\": '<path d=\"M9 18V6l10-2v12\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"16\" r=\"3\"/>',\n+    \"split\": '<path d=\"M5 5v4c0 4 3 4 7 4h7\"/><path d=\"M15 9l4 4-4 4\"/><path d=\"M5 19v-4c0-4 3-4 7-4h7\"/>',\n+    \"pitch\": '<path d=\"M3 17l4-5 4 3 5-8 5 3\"/><path d=\"M3 21h18\"/>',\n+    \"play\": '<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M10 8l6 4-6 4V8z\"/>',\n+    \"mic\": '<rect x=\"9\" y=\"3\" width=\"6\" height=\"12\" rx=\"3\"/><path d=\"M5 11a7 7 0 0014 0M12 18v3M8 21h8\"/>',\n+    \"blocks\": '<rect x=\"3\" y=\"6\" width=\"5\" height=\"12\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"3\" width=\"5\" height=\"18\" rx=\"1\"/><rect x=\"17\" y=\"8\" width=\"4\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"/>',\n+    \"stabilize\": '<path d=\"M3 13h3l2-5 3 9 3-7 2 3h5\"/><path d=\"M4 20h16\"/>',\n+    \"display\": '<rect x=\"3\" y=\"4\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M8 21h8M12 17v4\"/>',\n+    \"record\": '<circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4\"/>',\n+    \"align\": '<path d=\"M4 6h5c3 0 3 6 6 6h5\"/><path d=\"M4 18h5c3 0 3-6 6-6\"/><path d=\"M17 9l3 3-3 3\"/>',\n+    \"metrics\": '<path d=\"M4 20V10h4v10M10 20V5h4v15M16 20v-7h4v7\"/><path d=\"M2 20h20\"/>',\n+    \"segments\": '<path d=\"M3 7h5v10H3zM10 7h5v10h-5zM17 7h4v10h-4z\"/><path d=\"M3 20h18\"/>',\n+    \"feedback\": '<path d=\"M4 4h16v12H9l-5 4V4z\"/><path d=\"M8 8h8M8 12h5\"/>',\n+    \"results\": '<rect x=\"5\" y=\"3\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M9 3v3h6V3M8 12l3 3 5-6\"/>',\n+}\n+\n+\n+def icon_markup(name, x, y, size=28, color=None):\n+    color = color or COLORS[\"ink\"]\n+    scale = size / 24\n+    return (\n+        f'<g transform=\"translate({x} {y}) scale({scale})\" fill=\"none\" '\n+        f'stroke=\"{color}\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" '\n+        f'stroke-linejoin=\"round\">{ICONS[name]}</g>'\n+    )\n+\n+\n+def icon_data_uri(name):\n+    svg = (\n+        '<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" '\n+        f'fill=\"none\" stroke=\"{COLORS[\"ink\"]}\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" '\n+        f'stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">{ICONS[name]}</svg>'\n+    )\n+    return \"data:image/svg+xml,\" + quote(svg, safe=\"\")\n+\n \n@@ -49,8 +95,15 @@\n         label = [label]\n-    return \"\\n\".join(\n-        [\n+    icon = node.get(\"icon\")\n+    icon_size = node.get(\"icon_size\", 27)\n+    content = [\n             f'<rect x=\"{x}\" y=\"{y}\" width=\"{w}\" height=\"{h}\" rx=\"{radius}\" '\n             f'fill=\"{fill}\" stroke=\"{stroke}\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>',\n+    ]\n+    text_x = x + w / 2\n+    if icon:\n+        content.append(icon_markup(icon, x + 14, y + (h - icon_size) / 2, icon_size))\n+        text_x += min(16, w * 0.06)\n+    content.append(\n             svg_text(\n-                x + w / 2,\n+                text_x,\n                 y + h / 2 + node.get(\"text_dy\", 7),\n@@ -59,5 +112,5 @@\n                 node.get(\"weight\", \"normal\"),\n-            ),\n-        ]\n+            )\n     )\n+    return \"\\n\".join(content)\n \n@@ -136,5 +189,11 @@\n     for node in nodes:\n+        icon_style = \"\"\n+        if node.get(\"icon\"):\n+            icon_style = (\n+                f'shape=label;image={icon_data_uri(node[\"icon\"])};imageWidth=26;imageHeight=26;'\n+                'imageAlign=left;imageVerticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=38;'\n+            )\n         cells.append(\n             f'<mxCell id=\"{node[\"id\"]}\" value=\"{drawio_value(node[\"label\"])}\" '\n-            f'style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize={node.get(\"font_size\", 18)};'\n+            f'style=\"rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize={node.get(\"font_size\", 18)};{icon_style}'\n             f'fillColor={node.get(\"fill\", COLORS[\"white\"])};strokeColor={node.get(\"stroke\", COLORS[\"line\"])};'\n"}], "status": "completed"}}
